1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,584
Seorang ibu berlari tujuh kali

2
00:00:01,604 --> 00:00:02,672
di antara dua bukit.

3
00:00:02,692 --> 00:00:03,973
Jutaan orang mengulang

4
00:00:03,993 --> 00:00:05,227
langkahnya setiap tahun,

5
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:06,178
sampai hari ini.

6
00:00:06,198 --> 00:00:08,159
Hadis riwayat Bukhari dari

7
00:00:08,179 --> 00:00:09,464
Ibnu Abbas:

8
00:00:09,484 --> 00:00:11,631
Nabi Ibrahim membawa Hajar dan

9
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:13,588
bayinya, Ismail,

10
00:00:13,608 --> 00:00:15,377
ke lembah dekat Ka'bah.

11
00:00:15,397 --> 00:00:17,127
Saat itu tidak ada seorang pun

12
00:00:17,147 --> 00:00:17,777
di Makkah,

13
00:00:17,797 --> 00:00:19,810
dan tidak ada air.

14
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,343
Ia meninggalkan sekantong

15
00:00:21,363 --> 00:00:23,204
kurma dan sedikit air,

16
00:00:23,224 --> 00:00:24,566
lalu berjalan pergi.

17
00:00:24,586 --> 00:00:25,693
Hajar bertanya:

18
00:00:25,713 --> 00:00:26,590
apakah Allah yang

19
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,708
memerintahkanmu?

20
00:00:27,728 --> 00:00:28,792
Ibrahim menjawab:

21
00:00:28,812 --> 00:00:29,347
ya.

22
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:30,743
Hajar berkata:

23
00:00:30,763 --> 00:00:32,008
kalau begitu,

24
00:00:32,028 --> 00:00:33,571
Dia tidak akan menyia-nyiakan

25
00:00:33,591 --> 00:00:34,202
kami.

26
00:00:34,222 --> 00:00:35,254
Dari kejauhan,

27
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:36,663
Ibrahim berdoa:

28
00:00:36,683 --> 00:00:38,072
ya Tuhan kami,

29
00:00:38,092 --> 00:00:39,480
aku tempatkan keturunanku di

30
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,369
lembah yang tak bertanaman,

31
00:00:41,389 --> 00:00:43,092
di dekat rumah-Mu yang suci.

32
00:00:43,112 --> 00:00:44,904
Itu surah Ibrahim ayat tiga

33
00:00:44,924 --> 00:00:45,661
puluh tujuh.

34
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:46,713
Air habis.

35
00:00:46,733 --> 00:00:48,339
Bayinya kehausan.

36
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:49,909
Hajar naik ke bukit Shafa,

37
00:00:49,929 --> 00:00:51,139
mencari siapa pun.

38
00:00:51,159 --> 00:00:51,932
Tidak ada.

39
00:00:51,952 --> 00:00:53,696
Ia berlari menuruni lembah ke

40
00:00:53,716 --> 00:00:54,816
bukit Marwah.

41
00:00:54,836 --> 00:00:55,547
Tidak ada.

42
00:00:55,567 --> 00:00:56,953
Ia mengulanginya tujuh kali.

43
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:57,573
Di kali terakhir,

44
00:00:57,593 --> 00:00:58,687
ia mendengar suara.

45
00:00:58,707 --> 00:01:00,158
Air memancar dari tanah.

46
00:01:00,178 --> 00:01:01,474
Ia membendungnya dengan kedua

47
00:01:01,494 --> 00:01:03,285
tangan, lalu mengisi kantong

48
00:01:03,305 --> 00:01:03,948
airnya.

49
00:01:03,968 --> 00:01:05,032
Itulah Zamzam.

50
00:01:05,052 --> 00:01:06,255
Rasulullah bersabda dalam

51
00:01:06,275 --> 00:01:07,339
hadis yang sama:

52
00:01:07,359 --> 00:01:08,593
itulah asal mula orang

53
00:01:08,613 --> 00:01:10,032
berjalan di antara Shafa dan

54
00:01:10,052 --> 00:01:10,721
Marwah.

55
00:01:10,741 --> 00:01:11,742
Dan Al-Qur'an menyebut

56
00:01:11,762 --> 00:01:13,533
keduanya termasuk syiar Allah.

57
00:01:13,553 --> 00:01:15,127
Tawakal bukan diam menunggu.

58
00:01:15,147 --> 00:01:15,932
Hajar yakin,

59
00:01:15,952 --> 00:01:17,047
lalu tetap berlari.

60
00:01:17,067 --> 00:01:18,130
Menurut kamu,

61
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:19,214
di bagian mana kita sering

62
00:01:19,234 --> 00:01:20,299
lupa berusaha?

63
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,444
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

64
00:01:21,464 --> 00:01:22,545
bersama AUDIRA.

